@startuml SD_UC_U2_Call_Service_QR
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14

actor "Khách hàng" as Guest
actor "Nhân viên Phục vụ" as Waitstaff
boundary "Giao diện Web" as UI
control "ServiceCallController" as Controller
participant "ServiceCallService" as Service
participant "ServiceCallRepository" as Repo
database "SQL Server" as DB

Guest -> UI: Quét QR tại bàn
activate UI
UI -> Controller: GET /api/tables/{qrCode}/menu
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: ValidateTable(qrCode)
activate Service
Service -> Repo: GetTableByQr(qrCode)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: SELECT Tables WHERE QrCode = @qr
activate DB
DB --> Repo: table
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: table
deactivate Repo

alt QR không hợp lệ hoặc bàn chưa check-in (Status != 'Occupied')
    Service --> Controller: Result.Fail
    Controller --> UI: 400 Bad Request
    UI --> Guest: Báo lỗi, đề nghị liên hệ nhân viên
else Hợp lệ
    Service --> Controller: Menu & danh mục yêu cầu
    Controller --> UI: 200 OK
    UI --> Guest: Hiển thị E-Menu & nút yêu cầu\n(gọi phục vụ, châm nước, đổi dụng cụ)
end
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller

Guest -> UI: Chọn yêu cầu & bấm Gửi

UI -> Controller: POST /api/tables/{id}/call-service
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: CreateRequest(dto)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: Insert(request)
activate Repo

Repo -> DB: INSERT ServiceRequests
activate DB
DB --> Repo: OK (Id)
deactivate DB

Repo --> Service: request
deactivate Repo

Service -> UI: PushSignalR("NewServiceCall")
UI --> Waitstaff: Hiển thị thông báo (kèm nút Xác nhận)

Service --> Controller: dto
deactivate Service

Controller --> UI: 201 Created
deactivate Controller

UI --> Guest: Đã gửi yêu cầu
deactivate UI

... Nhân viên hỗ trợ khách và bấm nút trên thông báo ...

Waitstaff -> UI: Bấm Xác nhận hoàn thành
activate UI

UI -> Controller: PATCH /api/service-calls/{id}/complete
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: CompleteRequest(id)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: UpdateStatus(id, "Completed")
activate Repo

Repo -> DB: UPDATE ServiceRequests
activate DB
DB --> Repo: OK
deactivate DB

Repo --> Service: OK
deactivate Repo

Service --> Controller: OK
deactivate Service

Controller --> UI: 200 OK
deactivate Controller

UI --> Waitstaff: Ẩn thông báo / Hoàn tất
deactivate UI

@enduml